<title>GUYANA: CRICKET-W.INDIES AND INDIA DRAW FINAL TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-W.INDIES AND INDIA DRAW FINAL TEST.</headline>
<dateline>GEORGETOWN, Guyana 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>West Indies and India drew the rain-ruined fifth and final test match at the Bourda ground on Monday. West Indies won the series 1-0.</p>
<p>Score: India 355 (R.Dravid 92, S.Tendulkar 83)</p>
<p>West Indies 144-3 (S.Chanderpaul 58 not out)  </p>
<p>West Indies first innings</p>
<p> S.Williams lbw Kumble		  44</p>
<p> S.Chanderpaul not out		  58</p>
<p> B.Lara c Sidhu b Joshi		 30</p>
<p> C.Hooper run out			  1</p>
<p> C.Brown not out			   0</p>
<p> Extras				     11</p>
<p> Total (for three wickets)	   144</p>
<p>Fall of wickets 1-72 2-127 3-144</p>
<p>Bowling: Prasad 7-0-37-0, Kuruvilla 7-1-34-0, Ganesh 7-2-24- 1, Kumble 4-1-30-1, Joshi 5-1-11-1</p>
<p>Match drawn. West Indies win series 1-0.</p>
</text>
